WEBVTT

01:37.580 --> 01:43.020
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.340 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 20]

01:46.210 --> 01:48.200
Lord Xie, save me!

01:56.509 --> 01:58.280
Bloodshed in a mourning hall

01:59.120 --> 02:00.430
is a grave taboo.

02:00.870 --> 02:02.470
But I've got a case to handle,

02:02.710 --> 02:04.560
so I can't concern myself with that.

02:04.560 --> 02:07.820
My family's case was merely
an old miscarriage of justice.

02:08.240 --> 02:10.240
Yet how many wrongful, tragic cases

02:10.400 --> 02:12.260
has Hengtang seen over the years?

02:12.850 --> 02:15.050
My family's case is hardly the only one.

02:19.910 --> 02:21.870
My purpose in coming this time

02:22.450 --> 02:25.120
is to bring Hengtang to order,
once and for all.

02:25.960 --> 02:27.540
As for these guilty lives,

02:28.000 --> 02:29.520
consider them

02:29.750 --> 02:31.750
extra lamps lit along the road
to the underworld

02:31.750 --> 02:33.880
to guide our loyal and righteous dead.

02:34.800 --> 02:37.000
I just don't know if they will be enough.

02:49.030 --> 02:50.070
My good nephew,

02:50.840 --> 02:51.960
you've done well.

02:52.560 --> 02:54.420
You've upheld the will of Heaven.

02:54.910 --> 02:57.240
If Zhenglun could
know of this from beyond the grave,

02:57.240 --> 02:59.120
he would find peace with the past.

03:01.910 --> 03:02.750
Lord Xie,

03:03.940 --> 03:05.530
your eldest son

03:06.240 --> 03:07.680
gave his life

03:08.120 --> 03:10.450
to help you rise in rank
and become an earl.

03:11.150 --> 03:13.120
And with just that offhand remark,

03:13.590 --> 03:17.450
you've decided that, for him,
all those past grievances are settled.

03:17.910 --> 03:19.170
Whether alive or dead,

03:19.680 --> 03:22.430
he is my son.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.430
And he will always obey me.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.120
Lord Shen!

03:30.070 --> 03:30.840
Lord Shen,

03:31.600 --> 03:33.000
my brother was murdered!

03:33.030 --> 03:34.800
He was murdered by this poisonous woman!

03:34.800 --> 03:35.560
Zhengjun,

03:35.870 --> 03:37.400
stop making a scene here.

03:37.430 --> 03:38.150
I'm not!

03:38.430 --> 03:39.360
Shut up!

03:45.120 --> 03:47.380
Haven't you made enough of a scene today?

03:59.560 --> 04:00.240
Lord Xie,

04:01.030 --> 04:03.360
does seeing me,
the son of your old friend,

04:04.840 --> 04:06.630
bring you any gratification?

04:08.310 --> 04:09.400
Gratified indeed.

04:10.190 --> 04:12.700
My old friend's name is cleared at last,

04:12.870 --> 04:14.560
my long-held wish fulfilled.

04:14.560 --> 04:17.720
And now, I've received

04:18.310 --> 04:20.370
even greater favor from His Majesty.

04:22.870 --> 04:24.680
I feel truly gratified.

04:48.270 --> 04:50.270
As for everyone present here today—

04:50.680 --> 04:52.740
the dead, drag them out and bury them;

04:53.040 --> 04:53.800
the living,

04:54.270 --> 04:55.330
take them all away!

05:05.870 --> 05:07.390
Cut the crap! Move!

05:19.280 --> 05:24.970
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

05:25.030 --> 05:31.100
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

05:29.430 --> 05:30.430
It's been a while.

05:31.170 --> 05:36.460
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

05:36.510 --> 05:42.570
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

05:42.650 --> 05:48.840
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

05:48.870 --> 05:55.130
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

05:55.220 --> 06:01.510
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

06:00.360 --> 06:07.170
[Commandant of Loyalty and Power
Xie Zhenglun]

06:01.540 --> 06:07.440
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

06:07.460 --> 06:13.630
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

06:13.650 --> 06:19.750
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

06:17.830 --> 06:20.730
[Mengliang]

06:19.770 --> 06:25.990
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

06:23.900 --> 06:27.110
[Commandant of Loyalty and Power
Xie Zhenglun]

06:26.010 --> 06:31.950
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

06:52.390 --> 06:53.360
Eldest Brother,

06:54.310 --> 06:55.830
I wonder if you find

06:56.750 --> 06:58.630
today's farce ridiculous.

07:00.120 --> 07:02.190
Please watch patiently from above.

07:00.470 --> 07:06.300
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

07:02.840 --> 07:05.280
[Mengliang]

07:03.000 --> 07:04.310
This show

07:05.480 --> 07:08.000
I've put on for you is far from over.

07:06.330 --> 07:12.230
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

07:12.470 --> 07:17.820
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

07:17.910 --> 07:23.310
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

07:32.390 --> 07:33.360
Help!

07:33.480 --> 07:34.630
Murder!

07:38.920 --> 07:39.870
Insolent!

07:44.190 --> 07:44.920
Get lost!

07:45.790 --> 07:47.850
You dare attempt to...

07:48.040 --> 07:49.600
attempt to kill me, the Head Madam?

07:49.600 --> 07:51.860
You'll be struck down by heaven for this!

07:57.120 --> 07:58.780
You caused my brother's death

07:59.150 --> 08:00.480
and drove my mother mad.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.520
I'll never let you off today.

08:03.010 --> 08:04.230
I must kill you!

08:16.000 --> 08:17.000
Run, then!

08:17.750 --> 08:19.630
Let's see how far you get.

08:22.680 --> 08:24.680
Let's see where you can possibly go.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.789
Rebellious son,

08:38.080 --> 08:39.270
how dare you

08:39.270 --> 08:41.000
attempt to kill the Head Madam!

08:42.080 --> 08:42.750
Father!

08:43.240 --> 08:44.540
He wasn't just my brother!

08:44.540 --> 08:46.030
He was your son too!

08:48.720 --> 08:49.390
Father.

08:50.000 --> 08:51.370
I don't need you to remind me,

08:51.370 --> 08:53.630
and I certainly don't need you
to make decisions for me!

08:53.630 --> 08:55.910
But how can I stand by
while this poisonous woman is right here?

08:55.910 --> 08:57.480
Then I'll confine you for 10 days!

08:57.480 --> 08:58.910
Let's see just how wild you really are!

08:58.910 --> 08:59.620
Servants!

08:59.870 --> 09:00.930
No need!

09:05.550 --> 09:07.880
I'll go to the estate
in the suburbs myself

09:08.360 --> 09:09.490
to be with my mother.

09:42.080 --> 09:42.870
Father,

09:44.240 --> 09:46.500
you can't blame Second Brother for this.

09:47.270 --> 09:50.670
Eldest Brother was appointed as
the Commandant of Loyalty and Power by His Majesty.

09:50.670 --> 09:51.960
If the culprit isn't severely punished,

09:51.960 --> 09:53.200
how can Eldest Brother's heroic soul

09:53.200 --> 09:54.430
rest in peace?

09:54.630 --> 09:55.870
And what would the people of Hengtang

09:55.870 --> 09:57.240
think of our family?

09:58.390 --> 09:59.270
Say no more.

10:03.720 --> 10:04.510
Wenzhuo,

10:05.840 --> 10:08.040
it seems I have no choice but to place you

10:08.360 --> 10:10.560
under house arrest in Wuzhu Courtyard.

10:12.750 --> 10:13.670
Tonight...

10:15.200 --> 10:16.720
I was almost killed.

10:17.480 --> 10:18.670
And instead of punishing them,

10:18.670 --> 10:20.000
you're confining me?

10:20.760 --> 10:22.080
Wenzhuo...

10:24.840 --> 10:25.750
Zhenglun

10:26.630 --> 10:30.200
was the most promising eldest son
of our family.

10:30.910 --> 10:31.840
Yet you...

10:33.840 --> 10:34.510
You've...

10:36.120 --> 10:38.380
destroyed the foundation of the family.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.390
It's only out of regard for

10:40.480 --> 10:42.010
your position as Head Madam

10:42.150 --> 10:43.080
that I...

10:43.960 --> 10:45.960
This is already a light punishment.

10:47.320 --> 10:49.180
You should take this opportunity

10:49.870 --> 10:51.730
to stay out of the fray for a while.

10:53.720 --> 10:56.250
Who is the most promising child
of the family?

10:58.080 --> 10:58.870
Zhenglun?

11:04.030 --> 11:05.910
Surely you haven't forgotten

11:07.480 --> 11:09.030
the fully formed baby boy

11:09.030 --> 11:10.750
who died in my womb.

11:11.330 --> 11:13.460
He was the true eldest legitimate son.

11:13.670 --> 11:15.910
He was the most promising child.

11:22.390 --> 11:23.120
Wenzhuo.

11:24.750 --> 11:27.280
If you hadn't deliberately
made me miscarry,

11:27.280 --> 11:28.930
by now

11:29.550 --> 11:31.960
he'd be old enough to serve the country,

11:32.030 --> 11:33.500
fight on the battlefield,

11:33.600 --> 11:35.260
and bring honor to the family!

11:37.750 --> 11:38.630
But now,

11:39.870 --> 11:42.890
every night, I hear him crying.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.440
He often cries out,

11:46.480 --> 11:47.270
"Mother,

11:48.750 --> 11:49.840
save me.

11:50.790 --> 11:51.670
Mother,

11:53.080 --> 11:54.000
save me.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.720
Mother,

11:57.550 --> 11:58.840
save me!"

11:58.840 --> 12:00.900
What nonsense are you talking about?

12:02.030 --> 12:03.490
Your miscarriage that day

12:03.670 --> 12:05.180
was purely an accident.

12:05.870 --> 12:07.750
The physician made it very clear.

12:08.440 --> 12:09.440
Only you

12:10.200 --> 12:11.530
became obsessed with it

12:11.910 --> 12:13.480
and refused to believe it.

12:16.150 --> 12:17.080
Mother,

12:18.320 --> 12:19.750
karma

12:20.630 --> 12:21.910
has been served.

12:23.360 --> 12:24.630
Accident or not...

12:27.080 --> 12:29.340
don't you know perfectly well yourself?

12:34.320 --> 12:35.750
Let karma have its way.

12:38.750 --> 12:40.080
Let it.

12:49.650 --> 12:50.870
Qingyuan.

12:53.840 --> 12:56.440
Don't you want to
seek justice for your mother?

12:57.320 --> 12:58.390
Seek it properly.

12:59.960 --> 13:01.890
This is how things have always been

13:02.840 --> 13:04.770
in this family's inner household.

13:05.120 --> 13:07.250
One grievance answered with another.

13:09.240 --> 13:10.550
But the root of it all

13:12.150 --> 13:14.150
is that you have a good father.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.600
He's

13:17.240 --> 13:18.910
the most heartless

13:19.960 --> 13:21.620
and venomous man in the world.

13:23.550 --> 13:25.480
You blame me for Zhenglun's death?

13:26.960 --> 13:28.620
Why don't you ask your father?

13:34.480 --> 13:35.810
Isn't Zhenglun's death

13:37.150 --> 13:38.750
exactly what you wanted?

13:40.000 --> 13:41.870
If Zhenglun hadn't died,

13:42.870 --> 13:45.270
you wouldn't have
your title of earl today.

13:46.670 --> 13:47.440
Wenzhuo!

13:47.750 --> 13:48.880
You've gone too far!

13:51.630 --> 13:53.270
I ask you to show some restraint.

13:53.270 --> 13:54.390
Mind your standing

13:55.870 --> 13:57.720
in front of the younger generation.

13:57.720 --> 13:59.030
My standing?

14:03.000 --> 14:05.200
I'm not Mei Yinghua.

14:08.080 --> 14:10.480
Didn't you climb to your present position,

14:12.030 --> 14:13.960
step by step,

14:14.720 --> 14:16.830
on the strength of my status?

14:18.320 --> 14:20.440
Save some face for yourself.

14:24.670 --> 14:26.960
Since we've come this far,

14:28.320 --> 14:30.630
let's have it out properly.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.790
Before the funeral,

14:33.360 --> 14:35.510
I'd already written to my brother.

14:35.790 --> 14:37.630
It shouldn't be long

14:38.150 --> 14:40.030
before he arrives in Hengtang.

14:40.240 --> 14:41.440
When he does,

14:42.720 --> 14:44.850
I'll let him have a proper talk with you

14:45.510 --> 14:47.310
about what my standing really is

14:48.030 --> 14:49.270
and whether I had

14:50.720 --> 14:52.850
anything to do with Zhenglun's death.

14:55.440 --> 14:57.440
How arrogant of you.

14:58.270 --> 15:01.120
You think that simply because
you have a powerful brother,

15:01.120 --> 15:04.500
you can murder
our Xie family's flesh and blood

15:05.480 --> 15:07.080
and get away with it?

15:09.790 --> 15:10.360
Take it.

15:10.670 --> 15:11.480
Show it to her.

15:25.670 --> 15:27.150
Our elder brother

15:27.150 --> 15:28.810
is busy with official duties.

15:29.000 --> 15:31.360
I'm afraid he won't be coming here soon.

15:31.690 --> 15:33.490
[To repay Your Majesty's trust, the Xie clan
vows to serve you for generations,]

15:33.520 --> 15:35.180
[safeguarding Jiangnan's
wealth and revenues unto death.]

15:35.290 --> 15:42.150
[Memorial; Your subject, Xie Shu]

15:42.450 --> 15:44.120
[Memorial; Your subject, Xie Shu]

15:52.360 --> 15:53.630
Nanny Liu.

15:56.270 --> 15:57.130
Yes, Old Madam.

15:57.750 --> 15:59.480
You have done all kinds of evil.

15:59.630 --> 16:01.480
You shall be punished
according to the family rules.

16:01.480 --> 16:02.360
Servants,

16:02.750 --> 16:03.870
drag her out

16:04.200 --> 16:05.530
and give her 20 strokes.

16:05.720 --> 16:06.440
Old Madam.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.960
I'm innocent, Old Madam!

16:07.960 --> 16:10.200
Whether she lives or dies
depends on her own fate!

16:10.200 --> 16:11.510
Old Madam, please spare me!

16:11.510 --> 16:12.390
Old Madam!

16:13.000 --> 16:13.870
Old Madam!

16:16.670 --> 16:17.630
Hu Wenzhuo,

16:18.480 --> 16:20.280
you've become far too arrogant.

16:20.840 --> 16:22.670
Your good days are over.

16:23.550 --> 16:25.680
According to the patriarch's wishes,

16:26.630 --> 16:27.830
you are to be confined

16:28.390 --> 16:30.320
in Wuzhu Courtyard as punishment.

16:30.750 --> 16:31.550
Servants!

16:31.600 --> 16:32.320
No need.

16:38.270 --> 16:39.910
I can walk there myself.

16:52.870 --> 16:54.320
Qingyuan.

16:56.840 --> 16:58.390
At the mourning hall,

16:58.840 --> 17:02.240
we were all trying to
stop Zhengjun from reading that letter.

17:03.000 --> 17:06.480
But you seemed to be
egging him on the whole time.

17:07.440 --> 17:11.000
Were you deliberately
trying to expose the scandal?

17:11.680 --> 17:12.880
I don't understand.

17:13.680 --> 17:14.790
I don't understand

17:14.790 --> 17:16.790
what you were trying to accomplish.

17:23.030 --> 17:23.880
Father,

17:24.550 --> 17:25.349
I

17:25.920 --> 17:28.319
didn't want to
bring shame upon the family.

17:28.790 --> 17:29.790
It's just that...

17:33.200 --> 17:34.720
It's just that I

17:35.030 --> 17:37.630
can't bear
that Eldest Brother died unjustly.

17:38.400 --> 17:40.000
He was a loyal subject
who protected the people

17:40.000 --> 17:41.920
and brought honor to the Xie family.

17:41.920 --> 17:42.980
Most importantly,

17:43.590 --> 17:45.720
he was just like you back then, Father.

17:46.350 --> 17:48.720
He ventured into
the Northern Frontier alone

17:48.720 --> 17:50.960
and made a name for the family
throughout the realm.

17:50.960 --> 17:53.220
But he was harmed by treacherous people.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.510
No matter what it takes,

17:54.510 --> 17:56.200
I must seek justice for him.

17:57.070 --> 17:58.510
Seek justice?

17:59.440 --> 18:01.370
After the things with Mei Yinghua,

18:02.510 --> 18:04.350
I warned you again and again

18:04.350 --> 18:05.550
not to cause trouble!

18:06.270 --> 18:07.240
Today,

18:07.640 --> 18:09.770
no matter what excuse you come up with,

18:10.270 --> 18:13.600
you intentionally stirred up trouble
in front of everyone.

18:14.400 --> 18:17.060
You must be punished
according to family rules.

18:17.640 --> 18:18.550
Yuejian,

18:19.720 --> 18:21.320
fetch the discipline ruler.

18:21.880 --> 18:22.740
Yes, Old Madam.

18:43.920 --> 18:45.580
I've just ascended the throne

18:45.680 --> 18:49.070
and indeed need to root out some of
the late Empero's corrupt officials.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.530
You want to use this matter

18:50.720 --> 18:52.880
to get me to approve
your return for revenge, huh?

18:52.880 --> 18:53.810
I wouldn't dare.

18:54.750 --> 18:56.480
This is merely what I, Shen Run,

18:56.590 --> 18:58.680
can do for Your Majesty on this journey.

18:58.680 --> 18:59.750
And if you fail?

19:00.240 --> 19:02.640
I'll submit to
whatever punishment Your Majesty decides.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.240
Very well.

19:04.110 --> 19:05.750
Since you have the desire
to avenge your father

19:05.750 --> 19:07.480
and the resolve to ease my burdens,

19:07.480 --> 19:08.810
I shall grant your wish.

19:08.960 --> 19:10.490
But there is one more thing.

19:10.750 --> 19:11.880
When you return this time,

19:11.880 --> 19:13.480
you are bound to spill blood.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.480
But there is one person
you can't lay a hand on.

19:14.720 --> 19:18.060
[Memorial; Your subject, Xie Shu]

19:15.920 --> 19:17.980
And you must also keep him safe for me.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.270
Who is it?

19:20.960 --> 19:21.720
Xie Shu.

19:24.000 --> 19:24.800
Your Majesty,

19:25.270 --> 19:27.000
his crimes are beyond measure.

19:27.070 --> 19:29.590
-All of this is because...
-Keep Xie Shu safe.

19:29.590 --> 19:31.320
I want you to join hands with him

19:31.440 --> 19:33.350
and bring down the person behind him.

19:33.350 --> 19:34.480
This is my condition

19:34.550 --> 19:36.750
for allowing you to go back for revenge.

19:38.350 --> 19:39.000
Feng En.

19:45.830 --> 19:47.290
This matter is top secret.

19:47.590 --> 19:49.790
No one else may know of it.

19:52.880 --> 19:53.550
My Lord,

19:54.640 --> 19:57.370
do not forget
His Majesty's instructions to you.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.160
I don't want to sound harsh,

19:59.750 --> 20:01.750
but His Majesty's will is absolute.

20:01.920 --> 20:04.310
This matter cannot be leaked
in the slightest.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.920
Whoever you intend to meet,

20:06.270 --> 20:08.330
I'll remain outside and stand guard.

20:08.680 --> 20:09.750
Please, My Lord,

20:10.200 --> 20:12.200
do not make things difficult for me.

20:27.270 --> 20:28.030
Mother,

20:28.830 --> 20:30.560
these are the dried persimmons

20:31.350 --> 20:33.950
my eldest brother loved most
when he was alive.

20:35.070 --> 20:36.480
Bring them over, then.

20:45.590 --> 20:46.270
Sit.

21:05.880 --> 21:06.790
So sweet.

21:11.550 --> 21:14.010
You thought I wouldn't dare
eat them, right?

21:26.880 --> 21:29.680
Are you expecting me
to be like Mei Yinghua,

21:31.240 --> 21:33.310
terrified of
some so-called karmic retribution

21:33.310 --> 21:34.640
and driven mad by fear?

21:38.590 --> 21:40.240
I saw through you long ago.

21:42.200 --> 21:44.660
You've schemed your way
back into the family

21:45.070 --> 21:47.530
just to seek justice
for your mother, right?

21:51.350 --> 21:52.310
If

21:53.720 --> 21:55.720
these petty tricks are all you have,

21:56.030 --> 21:56.960
I advise you

21:57.440 --> 21:59.160
to give up.

22:02.200 --> 22:03.640
You won't be driven mad,

22:04.720 --> 22:06.780
nor will you regret what you've done.

22:07.400 --> 22:10.130
You hid your hand
far better than Mei Yinghua did—

22:10.480 --> 22:12.880
and you're even more ruthless
than she was.

22:13.030 --> 22:16.000
For your own petty interests,

22:16.720 --> 22:20.550
you dared to move against an official
with illustrious military merit.

22:20.550 --> 22:22.160
So why would you possibly fear

22:22.160 --> 22:23.620
mere karmic retribution?

22:31.200 --> 22:33.200
What are you here for today?

22:34.920 --> 22:38.160
If you've come to flaunt your triumph,

22:38.790 --> 22:40.160
then you're too early.

22:41.030 --> 22:42.440
It won't be long

22:43.590 --> 22:45.920
before I step out of this Wuzhu Courtyard.

22:47.070 --> 22:48.400
The blood debt you owe

22:49.310 --> 22:52.440
for my eldest brother's death
will be settled sooner or later.

22:52.440 --> 22:53.550
I'm not in a hurry.

22:56.310 --> 22:57.310
I came today

22:57.880 --> 23:00.340
because there's something
I want to ask you.

23:01.400 --> 23:02.310
Nine years ago,

23:02.920 --> 23:04.720
a few days before my mother died,

23:04.830 --> 23:06.030
you came to our house.

23:06.830 --> 23:08.890
What exactly did you say to my mother?

23:14.720 --> 23:16.030
You know about that?

23:17.000 --> 23:18.790
I recognized the hairpin you wore that day

23:18.790 --> 23:20.270
the moment I saw it.

23:20.590 --> 23:21.990
There's no mistaking it.

23:36.310 --> 23:40.350
You think that just because I saw her,
I'm the murderer?

23:44.110 --> 23:45.110
How naive.

23:48.830 --> 23:49.880
What a pity.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.520
You've got the wrong person.

23:55.880 --> 23:57.540
The one who harmed your mother

23:58.070 --> 23:59.470
was neither Second Madam

24:00.400 --> 24:01.510
nor me.

24:03.000 --> 24:05.260
Of course I know who the real murderer is.

24:14.790 --> 24:16.310
Is knowing who it is

24:17.160 --> 24:18.000
enough?

24:26.160 --> 24:27.750
You think all of this

24:27.960 --> 24:30.020
is connected to Fifth Madam's death?

24:31.000 --> 24:32.800
Then you're being far too naive.

24:33.160 --> 24:35.960
Back then, your father loved
your mother so deeply

24:37.160 --> 24:39.790
that even if she'd committed
some unforgivable offense,

24:39.790 --> 24:40.960
he would never

24:41.480 --> 24:43.680
have had the heart to lay a finger on her.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.480
So why

24:46.590 --> 24:48.110
would he agree to let your mother

24:48.110 --> 24:50.110
leave the residence of her own accord,

24:50.110 --> 24:52.000
then not look for her for 9 years,

24:52.000 --> 24:54.350
only to kill her as soon as he found her?

24:59.240 --> 25:01.570
Everything that happened to your mother,

25:01.830 --> 25:03.030
including her death,

25:05.920 --> 25:07.200
was because

25:09.110 --> 25:12.240
Xie Shu has a secret
he could never reveal.

25:13.510 --> 25:14.310
What secret?

25:24.790 --> 25:26.920
A secret that could shake the heavens.

25:37.720 --> 25:38.720
I might as well...

25:40.510 --> 25:41.790
tell you directly.

25:46.110 --> 25:47.070
That secret

25:48.510 --> 25:50.840
is hidden on your mother's bronze mirror.

25:51.030 --> 25:52.690
As for whether you can find it,

25:53.680 --> 25:55.340
that depends on your ability.

25:59.510 --> 26:00.270
However,

26:01.240 --> 26:02.750
you'd better hurry.

26:05.000 --> 26:07.200
Once I walk out of this Wuzhu Courtyard,

26:09.240 --> 26:10.700
who knows who'll be the one

26:11.270 --> 26:13.070
placed under house arrest next?

26:24.440 --> 26:26.480
My Lord, the letter
you wrote to His Majesty

26:26.480 --> 26:28.010
was brilliantly composed.

26:28.680 --> 26:30.110
First, you grieved over

26:30.240 --> 26:32.640
your eldest son's death
in service to the country—

26:32.640 --> 26:34.880
weeping your way into
the title of Earl of Zhongyong.

26:34.880 --> 26:37.480
Then you exposed
some corrupt officials here,

26:37.720 --> 26:40.250
all the while
clearing yourself of any blame.

26:41.200 --> 26:44.310
I don't understand what you're saying,
my dear nephew.

26:44.830 --> 26:47.750
I was merely expressing, as a father,

26:48.510 --> 26:52.160
my grief over losing a son.

26:59.310 --> 27:01.880
My Lord only named a few small fry

27:02.790 --> 27:04.310
and didn't mention a word

27:04.510 --> 27:06.000
about the man backing you.

27:07.750 --> 27:08.880
What man backing me?

27:09.680 --> 27:13.400
My dear nephew, you've been
on a killing spree in Hengtang lately,

27:13.750 --> 27:16.000
searching high and low
to uncover corruption.

27:16.000 --> 27:18.200
There's nothing you can't dig up.

27:20.640 --> 27:21.680
I found him.

27:23.070 --> 27:24.530
Isn't he right behind you?

27:25.270 --> 27:28.270
That's why His Majesty has chosen to
elevate your rank

27:28.350 --> 27:30.010
and ordered me to protect you.

27:30.270 --> 27:32.670
Isn't it just to uproot
the man backing you?

27:34.310 --> 27:35.510
You found the person?

27:35.680 --> 27:36.960
Who is this person?

27:37.350 --> 27:38.280
Tell me quickly.

27:42.640 --> 27:43.590
You think

27:44.680 --> 27:46.810
not saying his name will keep you safe?

27:48.240 --> 27:50.310
If the man behind you learns

27:51.590 --> 27:54.790
that His Majesty intends to
support you in replacing him,

27:54.790 --> 27:56.390
do you think he'll let you go?

28:04.680 --> 28:07.880
Ever since you rose to high office,

28:08.310 --> 28:11.680
your words have grown
increasingly cryptic.

28:12.400 --> 28:14.590
I don't quite understand.

28:15.110 --> 28:16.270
But in any case,

28:17.310 --> 28:18.160
I know—

28:18.640 --> 28:21.830
you would never let that man find out,

28:22.310 --> 28:23.110
right?

28:24.030 --> 28:26.350
The only thing I know

28:26.350 --> 28:28.030
is that you're here this time

28:28.550 --> 28:32.110
under the Emperor's order to keep me safe.

28:32.960 --> 28:33.720
Well...

28:37.830 --> 28:39.960
What is there to protect me from?

28:40.240 --> 28:42.770
Yet you've been
put to the trouble of doing it.

28:43.200 --> 28:44.270
Don't worry.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.880
Unless something serious happens,

28:45.880 --> 28:48.550
I won't trouble you.

28:53.880 --> 28:55.270
Lord Xie, you're right.

28:56.310 --> 28:58.590
An imperial decree may
protect you for a while,

28:58.590 --> 29:00.240
but not for a lifetime.

29:00.880 --> 29:03.350
You think that
with the title of Earl of Zhongyong

29:03.350 --> 29:04.640
and my protection,

29:05.070 --> 29:06.870
you'll be safe from everything?

29:07.240 --> 29:08.350
Lord Xie,

29:08.680 --> 29:09.590
we shall see.

29:15.240 --> 29:16.070
So noisy!

29:22.480 --> 29:25.070
The Hu family will
find out sooner or later

29:25.070 --> 29:27.310
that we've placed
Hu Wenzhuo under house arrest.

29:27.310 --> 29:29.350
The situation is currently unclear.

29:29.350 --> 29:30.920
If we fall out,

29:31.240 --> 29:33.000
both sides will suffer.

29:38.640 --> 29:40.480
We need to let the Hu family

29:41.590 --> 29:43.440
see our sincerity

29:44.200 --> 29:46.800
and think
that our loyalty remains unchanged.

29:47.270 --> 29:48.800
Since Qinghe's engagement

29:49.070 --> 29:51.070
has already been broken off anyway,

29:51.750 --> 29:53.680
why not send her birth details

29:54.590 --> 29:56.510
to the Hu family?

30:00.000 --> 30:01.240
You mean

30:02.000 --> 30:05.200
marry Qinghe into the Hu family
to continue the alliance?

30:05.750 --> 30:08.510
Qingyuan and Shen Run
are devoted to each other,

30:09.240 --> 30:11.350
so let them remain entangled.

30:11.790 --> 30:13.720
Qinghe will

30:14.000 --> 30:15.400
marry into the Hu family,

30:15.750 --> 30:17.240
while Qingyuan

30:17.830 --> 30:19.360
keeps Shen Run bound to her.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.640
It's like a game of chess—

30:23.240 --> 30:25.200
you're only truly secure when you

30:26.000 --> 30:27.550
have pieces on both sides.

30:28.590 --> 30:29.920
You're wise, Mother.

30:37.200 --> 30:38.720
It's getting late.

30:39.070 --> 30:40.550
You should go rest.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.000
Yes.

30:51.500 --> 30:59.550
♪ Lazy and flirtatious ♪

31:00.370 --> 31:09.000
♪ Drinking toasts ♪

31:10.370 --> 31:25.240
♪ A furrowed brow betrays her sorrow ♪

31:11.960 --> 31:13.000
Yes.

31:14.480 --> 31:17.790
It's time for this inner household
to welcome a new brides.

31:27.630 --> 31:45.460
♪ Why keep your heart
so guarded against me? ♪

31:35.440 --> 31:36.350
Chunqing?

31:57.790 --> 31:58.720
Yuejian.

32:09.310 --> 32:10.440
Master.

32:17.300 --> 32:20.830
[Danyue Pavilion]

32:21.590 --> 32:22.310
I heard

32:22.880 --> 32:24.280
you're going to marry me.

32:26.830 --> 32:29.030
There's one more thing I want to ask you.

32:29.110 --> 32:30.570
Why have you pushed Xie Shu

32:30.590 --> 32:32.160
so hard

32:32.720 --> 32:36.180
that he's rushing to marry off
his 2 daughters to climb higher?

32:38.070 --> 32:40.530
I was trying to expose
the forces behind him.

32:40.960 --> 32:43.220
I never meant to harm your eldest sister.

32:43.270 --> 32:44.070
If you ever

32:44.270 --> 32:45.350
need my help,

32:45.350 --> 32:46.160
just ask.

32:55.240 --> 32:56.400
You once told me

32:56.720 --> 32:58.070
that when you returned,

32:58.350 --> 33:01.270
you would take revenge on those
who framed your father

33:01.270 --> 33:04.730
and on the corrupt officials
who oppressed the common people.

33:06.200 --> 33:06.920
That

33:07.640 --> 33:08.900
also includes Xie Shu,

33:09.030 --> 33:09.680
right?

33:16.480 --> 33:16.920
Yes.

33:23.550 --> 33:25.610
You can move against anyone you want,

33:27.440 --> 33:28.720
but not Xie Shu.

33:35.440 --> 33:36.350
Why?

33:38.400 --> 33:41.060
He was just granted a title
because of Zhenglun.

33:42.070 --> 33:45.240
His Majesty personally named Xie Shu
the Earl of Zhongyong.

33:45.240 --> 33:46.570
Now is not the right time

33:46.720 --> 33:47.850
to move against him.

33:49.750 --> 33:50.510
No.

33:53.640 --> 33:54.790
You're lying.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.000
Tell me,

34:00.240 --> 34:01.570
what's the real reason?

34:02.440 --> 34:03.440
I just said it.

34:05.400 --> 34:08.670
His Majesty just conferred the title
of Earl of Zhongyong on Xie Shu.

34:08.670 --> 34:09.710
If you make a move against him now,

34:09.710 --> 34:11.840
you'll be moving against His Majesty.

34:13.760 --> 34:15.710
We will all die.

34:17.510 --> 34:19.969
And if I insist on
moving against him anyway?

34:22.670 --> 34:24.000
Then I will protect him.

34:36.760 --> 34:38.420
When I first met you as Yan Rui,

34:39.630 --> 34:42.110
everyone said you were
a big corrupt official.

34:42.110 --> 34:43.170
But no one expected

34:44.000 --> 34:46.000
that, in the end, you would be the one

34:46.550 --> 34:49.210
to save countless starving people
in Hengtang.

34:49.280 --> 34:51.409
When you asked the Marquis for troops,

34:51.670 --> 34:53.030
you said yourself

34:53.710 --> 34:55.110
that you came to Hengtang

34:55.590 --> 34:56.920
for three things:

34:57.880 --> 34:58.880
disaster relief,

34:59.710 --> 35:00.910
bandit suppression,

35:01.590 --> 35:03.250
and corruption eradication.

35:05.880 --> 35:07.360
The Yan Rui in my heart

35:08.360 --> 35:09.880
was an upright hero

35:10.230 --> 35:11.960
who feared neither power nor authority.

35:11.960 --> 35:13.510
So deep down,

35:14.400 --> 35:15.840
you had long since been

35:16.480 --> 35:18.360
the Shen Run I knew back then.

35:21.880 --> 35:23.540
I waited for you all this time.

35:25.150 --> 35:26.680
I waited for you to come back

35:26.800 --> 35:28.150
so we could finish

35:28.480 --> 35:29.960
what we started.

35:30.710 --> 35:31.770
But what about now?

35:33.480 --> 35:35.070
You finally came back,

35:35.630 --> 35:37.960
but you tell me
you want to protect Xie Shu—

35:38.150 --> 35:39.750
protect a corrupt official,

35:39.960 --> 35:41.230
a murderer.

35:41.800 --> 35:43.190
All because

35:43.960 --> 35:45.690
His Majesty ordered you not to,

35:45.840 --> 35:46.900
and you got scared?

35:52.190 --> 35:53.920
You've truly disappointed me.

36:02.000 --> 36:03.260
Whether you're Yan Rui

36:04.450 --> 36:05.620
or Shen Run,

36:09.840 --> 36:11.700
since our paths are different...

36:15.880 --> 36:17.080
let's part ways here.

36:54.590 --> 36:55.450
Fourth Sister,

36:56.510 --> 36:57.670
why does the pastry

36:58.280 --> 36:59.960
taste a bit different today?

37:03.960 --> 37:04.820
Fourth Sister?

37:07.920 --> 37:09.320
What's strange about it?

37:11.150 --> 37:13.760
It tastes a bit bitter.

37:15.280 --> 37:16.920
This is a Solomon's seal cake.

37:16.920 --> 37:17.710
The bitterness comes

37:17.710 --> 37:20.110
from one of the ingredients—
Solomon's seal.

37:20.110 --> 37:21.360
You come from a wealthy family,
Young Master Li,

37:21.360 --> 37:23.030
so you may never have eaten it before.

37:23.030 --> 37:23.960
Solomon's seal

37:24.320 --> 37:25.980
grows all over the mountains.

37:26.150 --> 37:27.920
When I was a child,
drifting from place to place,

37:27.920 --> 37:29.480
whenever we didn't have enough to eat,

37:29.480 --> 37:30.960
my mother would go to the mountains

37:30.960 --> 37:33.070
to gather it
and make it into cakes for me.

37:33.070 --> 37:34.400
It can not only fill the stomach

37:34.400 --> 37:35.860
but also nourish the body.

37:39.030 --> 37:40.490
After hearing that story,

37:40.710 --> 37:41.800
I feel this bitterness

37:41.800 --> 37:43.230
has a flavor all its own.

37:46.400 --> 37:47.260
Fourth Sister,

37:47.710 --> 37:49.840
this seems to be the first time
you've told me

37:49.840 --> 37:50.770
about your past.

37:59.630 --> 38:00.670
Young Master Li,

38:02.110 --> 38:04.310
surely you've heard some of it already.

38:08.110 --> 38:09.630
My mother was a concubine.

38:09.960 --> 38:11.280
After being wrongfully accused,

38:11.280 --> 38:13.880
she left the Xie family
while pregnant with me.

38:14.360 --> 38:16.420
She raised me in a dilapidated house.

38:16.920 --> 38:18.320
Life was poor,

38:19.190 --> 38:19.960
but we were content.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.070
Charge!

38:26.510 --> 38:27.880
Come on!

38:29.480 --> 38:30.840
Charge!

38:34.230 --> 38:35.550
When I was 9,

38:36.670 --> 38:38.070
there was heavy snow.

38:38.320 --> 38:39.880
I was playing in the alley

38:40.800 --> 38:41.800
and bumped into

38:42.080 --> 38:43.490
a prominent nobleman.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.150
That very day,

38:45.880 --> 38:47.610
a big fire broke out at our home.

38:48.150 --> 38:49.480
As I climbed a ladder up

38:49.880 --> 38:51.550
to the attic room,

38:52.030 --> 38:53.190
I saw that nobleman

38:54.070 --> 38:56.150
glaring fiercely at my mother.

38:56.550 --> 38:57.360
My mother

38:58.280 --> 38:59.840
died in that fire.

39:00.760 --> 39:02.320
I often wonder:

39:02.800 --> 39:05.260
if I hadn't been
so caught up in play that day,

39:05.280 --> 39:06.400
if I hadn't gone

39:07.070 --> 39:09.130
with my friend to buy sweets that day,

39:09.440 --> 39:10.500
would my mother...

39:12.880 --> 39:14.280
still be alive?

39:17.550 --> 39:18.880
That wasn't your fault.

39:20.360 --> 39:21.560
What happened after?

39:21.880 --> 39:24.340
Why didn't you report it
to the authorities?

39:25.230 --> 39:27.030
That person held high status
and great power.

39:27.030 --> 39:29.160
Reporting him would've been useless.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.000
Outrageous.

39:32.440 --> 39:34.070
I'll definitely seek justice

39:34.070 --> 39:35.070
for your mother.

39:39.150 --> 39:40.210
Young Master Li...

39:42.440 --> 39:43.320
do you really mean it?

39:43.320 --> 39:44.280
Of course I do.

39:47.030 --> 39:48.490
Once you and I are married,

39:48.840 --> 39:50.630
you'll be the Young Madam of
the Marquis of Danyang's household.

39:50.630 --> 39:51.440
Your mother

39:51.810 --> 39:53.480
will be considered a relative of the Marquis's family.

39:53.480 --> 39:54.810
And since that murderer

39:55.360 --> 39:57.360
killed the relative of an official,

39:57.510 --> 39:58.960
he should be beheaded for it.

39:58.960 --> 40:00.630
As the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang,

40:00.630 --> 40:02.030
I can bypass the local government

40:02.030 --> 40:03.360
and petition the throne

40:03.670 --> 40:05.440
directly through the Eight Deliberations.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.170
At that time,

40:06.550 --> 40:08.610
I'll make that murderer pay in blood.

40:14.670 --> 40:16.200
Thank you, Young Master Li.

40:19.030 --> 40:20.830
It's just that this marriage...

40:23.840 --> 40:24.700
Fourth Sister.

40:27.630 --> 40:28.480
I know.

40:29.880 --> 40:31.740
I, Li Congxin, swear here and now:

40:32.230 --> 40:33.230
in this life,

40:33.960 --> 40:35.550
I will marry only you as my wife

40:35.550 --> 40:37.080
and never take a concubine.

40:37.280 --> 40:39.190
I will never let you relive the tragedy

40:39.190 --> 40:41.920
your mother endured amid the intrigues of the inner household.
